    confidence 4 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
    comment "en" """
        Swedish fifth-character extension of X41 (accidental poisoning by
        antiepileptics/sedatives/psychotropics NEC).90=unspecified place/sports. Current nonstandard
        target 443283 (Poisoning by CNS drug) is deprecated. Weak to broad drug poisoning parent.
        """
}
